        "text_y6Nnxf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Synagogues, Shabbat program organizers, and households that light weekly through the year can simplify restocking with bulk Shabbat candle orders. Consistent quality across a larger order means the same burn performance every week without sourcing from multiple places. For bulk Shabbat candles, wholesale pricing is available. Reach out through the contact page with your quantity and frequency to get started.<br/><br/></p>",
